# lima_disk (Data Source)

Reads an existing Lima disk. This data source never modifies the disk.

## Example usage

```hcl
data "lima_disk" "data" {
  name = "project-data"
}

output "guest_path" {
  value = data.lima_disk.data.mount_point
}

output "free_to_destroy" {
  value = data.lima_disk.data.in_use_by == null
}
```

